7. After hearing the arguments, the Tribunal has framed the following points;
1. Whether the petitioner proves that he has sustained multiple and injuries in the accident due to the rash and negligent act of driver of APE goods auto bearing Reg.No.KA.07-7672 which occurred on 9-2-2016 at about 3.00 p.m. near Parashurama temple, Kolar on Mulbagal road when the petitioner was traveling in his two wheeler Reg.No.KA.07.W.9557?
NC: 2023:KHC:20977 2.
